{"brief":{"scenario":"Buying a snack and a ready meal at a convenience store: ask for a shopping bag, request chopsticks, ask staff to heat food, ask whether card payment is possible, locate an item, and ask whether a smaller size is available. Each question should make the requested item or service explicit. Use distinct tasks, and make the last permission or availability question the hard comment bonus.","audience":"English-speaking adults learning practical beginner Korean","level":"Beginner: progress from short polite requests to location and availability questions; two easy, two medium, two hard","scenarioType":"convenience-store"},"approvedExamples":[{"prompt":"You need water. What do you say?","context":"Ask the café staff politely.","choices":[{"hangul":"물 있어요.","romanization":"mul isseoyo."},{"hangul":"물 주세요.","romanization":"mul juseyo."},{"hangul":"물 마셔요.","romanization":"mul masyeoyo."}],"correctAnswerIndex":1,"meaning":"Water, please.","teachingPoint":"주세요 = please give me"},{"prompt":"Order your drink without ice. What do you say?","context":"Ordering a cold drink.","choices":[{"hangul":"얼음 빼 주세요.","romanization":"eoreum ppae juseyo."},{"hangul":"얼음 더 주세요.","romanization":"eoreum deo juseyo."},{"hangul":"얼음 넣어 주세요.","romanization":"eoreum neoeo juseyo."}],"correctAnswerIndex":0,"meaning":"No ice, please.","teachingPoint":"빼 주세요 = leave it out; 더 주세요 = give more"}],"relevantPriorQuestions":[{"scenario":"At the counter","question":"you need water what do you say ask the café staff politely","taughtPhrase":"물주세요"},{"scenario":"Paying","question":"ask how much your drink costs you are ready to pay for your drink","taughtPhrase":"얼마예요"},{"scenario":"Choosing takeaway","question":"you want your drink to go what do you say you are leaving the café","taughtPhrase":"포장해주세요"},{"scenario":"Customizing a drink","question":"order your drink without ice what do you say ordering a cold drink","taughtPhrase":"얼음빼주세요"},{"scenario":"Fixing an order","question":"ask to replace the coffee with tea you ordered tea but received coffee","taughtPhrase":"차로바꿔주세요"},{"scenario":"Choosing an alternative","question":"ask for an americano instead your first choice is sold out no drink is served","taughtPhrase":"아메리카노로주세요"},{"scenario":"Arriving at the café","question":"greet the café staff politely say hello as you enter","taughtPhrase":"안녕하세요"},{"scenario":"Ordering a drink","question":"order one cup of coffee ask for exactly one coffee not tea","taughtPhrase":"커피한잔주세요"},{"scenario":"Choosing a temperature","question":"order a hot coffee you do not want a cold drink or tea","taughtPhrase":"따뜻한커피주세요"},{"scenario":"Adding milk","question":"ask for milk in your coffee add milk rather than sugar","taughtPhrase":"우유넣어주세요"},{"scenario":"Clearing your table","question":"ask where to put your empty cup you have finished your drink","taughtPhrase":"컵은어디에놓으면돼요"},{"scenario":"Requesting permission","question":"ask if you may charge your phone request permission to use the café outlet","taughtPhrase":"여기서충전해도돼요"}]}
